DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43534::$$$message_0367_0000_0000$$$::"Another point! Saber and Shirou, you lose!"[nolr][p]::
43535::$$$message_0367_0000_0001$$$::"Blarg."::
43536::$$$message_0367_0000_0002$$$::"...I'm surprised. Taiga, we really won."::
43537::$$$message_0367_0001_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=真剣 time=200][hfchance layer=1]"No, that's not what surprises me..."::
43538::$$$message_0367_0001_0001$$$::"Argh... W-why does the Holy Grail War have such a rule..."::
43539::$$$message_0367_0001_0002$$$::"Because it's more fun that way!"::
43540::$$$message_0367_0001_0003$$$::"You just don't get it, Saber. I'm all about the fun factor first and foremost, [wait canskip=0 time=400][l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=怒 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][large][say storage=HSTR2A_TIG_0040 _name=藤ねえ]yo![rf]"::
43541::$$$message_0367_0002_0000$$$::"Right, now that you mention it... [l][hffacechg chara=セイバー face=哀2 layer=0 time=200][say storage=HSTR2A_SAV_0030 _name=セイバー]You are a terrifying foe, Taiga Fujimura. [l][hffeelblue layer=0][say storage=HSTR2A_SAV_0040 _name=セイバー] (keels over)"[nolr][p]::
43542::$$$message_0367_0002_0001$$$::"Wow... [l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=喜2 layer=0 time=200][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTR2A_BIR_0040 _name=ブルマイリヤ]That was incredible, Taiga!"::
43543::$$$message_0367_0003_0000$$$::"Wasn't that a Reality Marble just now!?[lr]::
43544::$$$message_0367_0003_0001$$$::Where have you been hiding a secret move like that!?"::
43545::$$$message_0367_0003_0002$$$::"Hmm? What's a Reality Marble?"::
43546::$$$message_0367_0003_0003$$$::"It's a grand magecraft that temporarily materializes the caster's mental world and overwrites the real world with it."::
43547::$$$message_0367_0004_0000$$$::"You just applied it to competitive hanafuda."::
43548::$$$message_0367_0004_0001$$$::"Oh, so that's what it's called. I always use that on New Year's. It's pretty simple once you get the hang of it."::
43549::$$$message_0367_0004_0002$$$::"Really!? [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTR2A_BIR_0110 _name=ブルマイリヤ]That's so awesome!"::
43550::$$$message_0367_0004_0003$$$::"I wanna use it too! I want to unfold a wonderland just the way I like it! And stuff Shirou into a world of sexy times!"::
43551::$$$message_0367_0004_0004$$$::"Wahahahahaha[line len=3][l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=真剣 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR2A_TIG_0090 _name=藤ねえ]Haiyah."::
43552::$$$message_0367_0005_0000$$$::"Ow! [wait canskip=0 time=300][l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=哀 layer=0 time=200][hfangry layer=0][say storage=HSTR2A_BIR_0150 _name=ブルマイリヤ]H-h-how dare you raise a fist to your Master!"::
43553::$$$message_0367_0005_0001$$$::"Master and Servants have nothing to do with a proper education."::
43554::$$$message_0367_0005_0002$$$::"Listen, Illya. You might be able to skate by because you're a loli in gym shorts, but get cocky and you'll lose it."::
43555::$$$message_0367_0005_0003$$$::"Urgh. I'm afraid to ask what exactly I'll lose."[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=うーん layer=0 time=200]::
43556::$$$message_0367_0006_0000$$$::"...Tch. Fine, never mind for now. Can you really use a Reality Marble that simply, though?"::
43557::$$$message_0367_0006_0001$$$::"Sure. I just swung my practice sword every day and picked it up at some point. Hm, let me think..."::
43558::$$$message_0367_0006_0002$$$::"If you insist, I can consider it. Illya, if you'll become my student, then I don't mind teaching you how."::
43559::$$$message_0367_0006_0003$$$::"...Gah. [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTR2A_BIR_0200 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Are you serious?"::
43560::$$$message_0367_0006_0004$$$::"...Urgh. That's terribly tempting, but I want to believe that I won't sell out my pride that easily.[lr]::
43561::$$$message_0367_0006_0005$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=楽3 layer=0 time=200]Um. Let me think about it."::
43562::$$$message_0367_0006_0006$$$::"Boo. I thought I finally found a pupil worth training. [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=楽 layer=1 time=200][say storage=HSTR2A_TIG_0160 _name=藤ねえ]Well, feel free to come apologizing if you ever change your mind."::
43563::$$$message_0367_0006_0007$$$::"Anyway, who are we fighting next?[lr]::
43564::$$$message_0367_0006_0008$$$::We've finally dealt out some well-deserved punishment to Shirou...[playstop time=3000 nowait=true]"::
43565::$$$message_0367_0006_0009$$$::"...Hehehe."::
43566::$$$message_0367_0007_0000$$$::"No need to go hunting, Ms. Fujimura.[lr]::
43567::$$$message_0367_0007_0001$$$::If it's an enemy you want, I'll face you myself."::
43568::$$$message_0367_0008_0000$$$::"W-what is this dark pressure she can't hide no matter how hard she tries...![lr]::
43569::$$$message_0367_0008_0001$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=真剣2 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1]It's you...!"[nolr][p]::

